  "description" : "Chen Feng unexpectedly gains the ability to travel between the present world and the post-apocalyptic wasteland. Instead of traveling alone to trade, he proactively confesses to the nation, bringing zombie samples and gene serums with him, and publicly demonstrates his time-traveling ability, essentially \"handing over\" the entire post-apocalyptic world to the government. The nation quickly establishes the \"Fire Seed Project\" command center, initiating a cross-world strategic layout. Chen Feng leads a modern special forces unit back to the wasteland, using precision rifles, armored vehicles, and long-range rocket artillery to deliver a devastating blow to zombie hordes, wasteland warlords, and mutated tyrants. Simultaneously, post-apocalyptic black technology empowers the present world, propelling technological leaps forward, but also attracting the covetousness and encirclement of hostile superpowers. The story revolves around the nation`s machine crushing post-apocalyptic monsters and a dual-track rise, showcasing a grand journey of cross-world domination and civilizational upgrading.\nsource: movie.douban.com/googletranslate",
